    "id": "corpus_pages/CityBuilderGame.tsx",
    "title": "pages/CityBuilderGame.tsx",
    "content": "Unlocks advanced buildings & landmarks At Tech 2.5 / 4, unlocks T2 buildings / T3 landmarks. Catching-up & crisis loss control Boosts growth for trailing cities and cuts event-failure losses. Offsets industry & population pressure Low ecology drags all color production; higher ecology lowers the penalty. More build slots & faster construction At Infra 6 / 10, gain a build slot each and shorten build times. Amplifies regional cooperation Stronger tourism yields bigger color rewards when cross-city projects finish. Cheaper color trading Swap surplus colors for scarce ones; higher economy lowers each trade cost. Lifts whole-city production Scales passive output of all twelve colors, kept in balance by ecology. Strengthens adjacent networks Adjacent compatible colors grow together; higher culture strengthens adjacency. Handles health & population events Steady defense for health, welfare and food events. Defends tech, economy, tourism & security events and cuts failure losses. Sustains population & focus output When food lags population, city-wide production drops; surplus boosts focused color. Raises reserve caps & labor Increases capacity of all colors and slightly boosts focused output. Low-barrier R&D space building the tech base. City Research Institute Turns industry and public knowledge into steady innovation. City Intelligence Hub Coordinates city-wide data and automation — the tech landmark. Community Service Post Absorbs development pressure and helps trailing cities recover. Universal Service Center Widens public service coverage and cuts crisis losses. Links education, care and public space into a welfare landmark. Small greenery offsetting population and industry pressure. Zero-Carbon Wetland Cleans city metabolism and stabilizes twelve-color production. Urban Forest Ring A continuous green belt around dense districts. Expands build capacity and connects adjacent districts. City Trunk Network Speeds up large buildings and cross-city projects. Seamless Transfer Ring Ties every district into one efficient network. City Observation Deck Turns culture, food and space into appeal. Four-Season Tour Route Extends visitor stays and amplifies cooperation gains. A tourism landmark facing the whole city network. Opens color trading and eases shortages. Regional Exchange Port Lowers trade friction and supports complex supply chains. Public Wealth Center Converts diversified growth into efficient dispatch. Raises passive production of all colors. Collaborative Manufacturing Park Scales production via infrastructure and tech. Flexible Manufacturing Port An industrial landmark that reshapes output by city demand. Makes adjacent different colors reinforce each other. City Memory Museum Amplifies adjacency synergy in the planning network. City Memory Palace Weaves many lifestyles into a cultural landmark. Defends health, population and welfare events. General Medical Center Backs regional rescue with tech and welfare. Precision Medicine City A city-wide medical landmark and emergency base. Night Patrol Post Protects reserves and handles economy and flow risks. Resilience Command Center Links infrastructure, population and security. Holds the city's colors through major events. Puts ecology and industry output to real use. City Food Network Stabilizes population growth and boosts focus output. Citywide Food Garden Links production, table and tourism into a food landmark. Raises reserve caps and city labor scale. Livable New Town Absorbs steady arrivals with food and welfare. Mixed-Use Livable District A dense, multi-functional landmark district. Joint Compute Cloud Cities co-build an open R&D and compute network. Cross-City Welfare Hotline Keeps public service running across city borders. Watershed Joint Governance Upstream and downstream cities restore ecology together. Intercity Transit Loop High-speed public transport linking all cities. Metro Area Four-Season Fest Continuous routes of multi-city culture and food. Regional Color Exchange Reduces misallocation within the city network. Collaborative Manufacturing Chain Lets tech, infra and factories work across cities. Public Culture Season Cities create and share a common stage. Joint Emergency Network Cross-city dispatch of beds, tech and care. Regional Resilience Grid Joint response to safety, transit and information risks. Regional Food Network Links ecological farms, manufacturing and tables. Shared Talent Housing Plan Housing and services for a mobile population. City System Outage Key digital systems fail in a chain. Public Service Crunch Service demand surges in a short window. Heat Island Alert Prolonged heat tests green space and services. Rain strains transit and drainage at once. Sudden crowds flood scenic spots and public space. Regional demand shifts abruptly; supply chains wobble. Production Line Accident Manufacturing stops with secondary risks. Public Memory Gap Urban renewal erases shared memories fast. Seasonal flu quickly fills medical capacity. Fraud in the information network spikes. Transport blockages strain tables. Many residents arrive at once; capacity is tested. city-cost-row city-cost-chip city-score-formula Color score = (attribute value + rank points for that color) × core multiplier city-subway-lab city-subway-controls city-subway-results city-dialog city-rulebook city-full-rules city-rules-title city-rulebook-grid city-rulebook-attributes-title city-rulebook-attributes city-builder city-setup REAL-TIME / TWELVE-COLOR CITY NETWORK city-setup-title city-hero-points city-setup-panel city-core-title city-section-heading city-core-grid city-setup-options city-duration-options city-setup-actions city-secondary-button Hide full rules Read full rules city-primary-button city-leader-core city-resource-board city-resources-title city-section-heading compact city-resource-grid city-resource-name city-resource-values city-map-panel city-map-title city-panel-title city-map-stats city-locked-tile city-empty-tile city-map-building is-upgrade-target city-map-building city-map-hint Pick an empty plot to place \" Pick a same-color T building to upgrade into \" Pick a building from the library on the right. Dependency colors that are orthogonally adjacent grow together. city-library-title city-library-colors city-building-cards city-building-card-top city-dependency-note city-network-panel city-exchange-card city-mini-color-grid city-project-card Waiting for the next regional plan city-project-contributors city-requirement-list A new project opens in Not enough time remains for a new project; regional build-out is wrapped up. city-event-card The city network is calm city-defense-meter city-event-actions Defense threshold met Adjust focus and trade colors during the warning Commit response colors to avoid losing event reserves. Next warning arrives in about No new events will start with too little time to resolve. city-dialog city-final city-final-title FINAL CITY NETWORK REPORT tie for first city-final-ranking city-final-colors city-final-metrics city-dialog city-local-pause nc-game-session-state city-builder city-game city-game-surface city-game-header city-game-identity city-live-score city-game-controls city-speed-control city-main-grid city-game-summary",
